ne  but they pack a gorier punch than they  did in the age of the greeks  there are also new finishes that you can  use like stomping an enemy to death once  you've knocked them down  aval's arsenal is also more versatile  than you'll be used to  they can dual wield any weapon in each  hand or two shields if you prefer  and weapons function differently  depending on whether they're in your  primary or secondary hand  that's not to say avor doesn't still  have a full suite of stealth abilities  up his or her sleeve  although being far larger than their  greek protagonist counterpart they do  look a little funny trying to crouch  behind  a cart to perform a stealth  assassination aval's stoic personality  in our three-hour hands-on this  characterization largely rang true  while our session was primarily combat  focused a handful of main and side  quests gave us a further look into  aval's personality in my playthrough she  was indeed revered by those around her  generally kind-hearted earnest righteous  diplomatic  confident and somewhat stoic but not  devoid of humor  she appeared less jovial and more mature  than cassandra or alexius which comes  with the territory of her position  but she still had quips to counter her  friends in lighter scenarios  you're very strong you're very large  evil's romantic opportunities we even  had the opportunity to engage in a love  scene where you get the option to  accidentally or deliberately forget the  name of the gentleman you just ducked  out for a private moment with  we've been told romantic options in  valhalla will be more serious  if that's the way you want to go with  them this time around but it still seems  like there's room for the casual  approach if you prefer that  for your avor i shall as well growth  here  ruther i'm not brutal  bullies balls you thought i was my  brother  to be honest i did not think at all  abel's flexible dna  but what about the elephant in the room  that is the conceit behind being able to  play as a male  or female avail and to switch between  them at any time  that was one of our biggest questions  out of the demo and we were told that  the core reason behind that  is a mystery but basically the genetic  memory stream wherein you access an  ancestors memories  is conflating the dna of male and female  evil which is why there's some  uncertainty as to aval's gender  we've been assured that it'll all make  sense by late in the game  the mystery of aval's deadly ambition  there's plenty more to the mystery of  avor  a feature alluded to heavily in  ubisoft's latest trailer called avors  fate  that weaves together elements of the  viking invasion into england  as well as supernatural and political  facets  the suggestion that aval's ambition and  drive to achieve glory may be their  undoing  is certainly intriguing and important if  we're assumingly set for another 70 plus  hour epic adventure  if you want to know more about how it's  all gonna go down do check out our other  features on assassin's creed valhalla  including our full hands-on impressions  and let us know who your all-time  favorite ac protagonist is and why down  in that comment box  you
 

